//          .+0x3c |
//          ..+0x0c |
//          ...+0x20 |
//          ....+0x18 | [32-bit] Rico the Beachcomber: Collected Items
//          ....+0x1c | [32-bit] Rico the Beachcomber: Total (0x0a)
